# This machine's own selections -- theme, units, log source (#74). Untracked
# by design: config.json holds the tracked definitions and is never written
# at runtime, so changing the theme can no longer leave a modified tracked
# file behind (which used to block --ff-only merges, see #73).
data/config.local.json
data/config.local.json.tmp
# Projects panel cache (#62). Unlike the rest of data/, this is not just
# machine-local state -- it holds repo names and issue counts for every
# private org the gh token can see, so it must never be committed.
data/projects.json
